WEBVTT

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:19.200
<i>C'mon, morning's here--time to be on our way</i>

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:24.700
<i>Smiling faces, courage,</i>
<i>we're bustin' out: glory days!</i>

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:29.830
<i>You ready or not? Ready or not, go!</i>
<i>No turning back: this trip is nonfiction</i>

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:35.080
<i>You ready or not? Ready or not, go!</i>
<i>It's now or never, the real deal: Ready, and... action!</i>

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:40.540
<i>Harsh winds that make us hesitate,</i>
<i>nights spent crying our eyes out</i>

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:45.790
<i>They're not necessarily bad things (not bad)</i>

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:51.500
<i>Just like the power in a spring:</i>
<i>the harder we're pushed</i>

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:55.040
<i>The higher we can fly</i>

00:00:55.040 --> 00:01:05.580
<i>Face the far-off distance</i>
<i>and aim for the horizon: rising sun</i>

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:10.870
<i>Holding our hands up to that morning sun</i>

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:21.250
<i>Our shared feelings brought us together--</i>
<i>we're not alone anymore</i>

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:27.450
<i>And so we're on this brilliant voyage</i>

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:34.250
<i>Smiling faces, courage,</i>
<i>we're bustin' out: glory days!</i>

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:41.620
Under the rule of Ei Sei,
the king who worked toward unification,

00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:45.410
the kingdom of Chin launched
an invasion of the land of Gi.

00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:49.330
Their opponent: the legendary general Ren Pa.

00:01:49.330 --> 00:01:52.160
The young commanders stepped
onto a relentless battlefield,

00:01:52.160 --> 00:01:55.040
their sights set on a major victory.

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:05.660
Charge!

00:02:05.660 --> 00:02:07.450
We're breakin' on through!

00:02:07.450 --> 00:02:12.040
These guys just keep coming!
They must know we're shorthanded here!

00:02:15.950 --> 00:02:17.160
Our ranks are a mess!

00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:19.080
Front row, switch out!

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:28.500
Th-That did the trick--for now...

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:29.580
Stay sharp!

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:32.450
Put the unit back together, on the double!

00:02:34.370 --> 00:02:39.040
We're fighting right alongside you, Shin...

00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:40.950
Give 'em hell!

00:02:42.330 --> 00:02:46.160
I'm the man who inherited Ou Ki's poleax...

00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:48.830
...and his dying wish!

00:02:50.160 --> 00:02:54.410
And I'm the man who'll
surpass all those generals

00:02:54.410 --> 00:02:58.370
to be the greatest general in all of history!

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:09.330
The greatest general in all of history?
Aren't <i>you</i> thinking big!

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:13.750
Then you'll be surpassing my lord,
General Ren Pa.

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:15.500
Obviously!

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:19.910
After I kill you,
I'm goin' straight for Ren Pa!

00:03:26.450 --> 00:03:29.620
I do wish you wouldn't get so carried away.

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:33.370
After all, your lives will be ending here today.

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:41.040
<i>What's</i> ending, now?

00:03:43.370 --> 00:03:47.660
You two certainly are a handful!
Which is exactly why...

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:53.750
I'll need you to die right here and now.

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:58.540
Dammit! I know you're plenty strong and all,

00:03:58.540 --> 00:03:59.540
but still!

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:08.250
No matter what,

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:10.200
this is where

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:11.500
we kill him!

00:04:13.350 --> 00:04:18.360
"A Wall to be Overcome"

00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:00.620
His wound!

00:05:04.660 --> 00:05:07.410
You're mine!

00:05:28.580 --> 00:05:31.910
Is he man--or monster?

00:05:31.910 --> 00:05:33.160
Commander!

00:05:34.410 --> 00:05:36.580
Get him! Kill Rin Ko!

00:05:36.580 --> 00:05:38.500
Stay back!

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:57.870
<i>I'm</i> the one who's gonna be takin' his head!

00:06:01.790 --> 00:06:03.450
But, Commander...

00:06:05.160 --> 00:06:08.870
Seems to me there's two kinds of generals.

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:19.330
Those who put themselves out
as pawns on the battlefield,

00:06:20.450 --> 00:06:22.500
and those like Ou Ki and Ren Pa,

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:24.500
who draw the attention of friend and foe alike

00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:28.200
and singlehandedly turn the tide of battle.

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:32.750
They're both generals,
but the gap between 'em is crazy huge.

00:06:33.950 --> 00:06:36.870
Rin Ko--he's probably the latter.

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:42.120
But I'm lookin' to climb even higher.

00:06:44.370 --> 00:06:45.370
And that's why...

00:06:47.120 --> 00:06:51.660
this guy's a wall I gotta get over!

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:16.410
I'm a spear, thrown by Ren Pa.

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:21.450
And if you, the man with Ou Ki's poleax,

00:07:21.450 --> 00:07:24.410
consider me a wall you must overcome,

00:07:24.410 --> 00:07:28.500
see if you can destroy me.

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:32.540
Hell, that much

00:07:32.540 --> 00:07:35.080
is a given!

00:07:40.040 --> 00:07:42.540
That day, the independent action taken

00:07:42.540 --> 00:07:45.580
by Shin and his fellow young
thousand-man commanders

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:49.250
brought new developments to the
central battle on the Rui Plains.

00:07:49.250 --> 00:07:51.750
Taking a broader view
of the battlefield, however,

00:07:51.750 --> 00:07:55.660
Chin's left flank, led by Kan Ki,
was still nowhere to be found,

00:07:55.660 --> 00:07:59.290
and Gi's Kai Shi Bou
had been stopped in his tracks.

00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:04.830
On the left, Ou Sen's army
continued its usual retreat

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:07.500
from Kyou En's attacks.

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:11.450
Both flanks' movements remained
unchanged from two days earlier.

00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:20.580
First and second squads, stand your ground!

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:23.540
Third, fourth, fifth, and sixth squads,
head down the ridge

00:08:23.540 --> 00:08:25.870
and strike the enemy all at once!

00:08:25.870 --> 00:08:29.120
But within the struggling Ou Sen army,

00:08:29.120 --> 00:08:33.540
only thousand-man commander Heki's
unit was heroically holding out.

00:08:33.540 --> 00:08:36.250
What are Ou Sen's main forces doing?

00:08:36.250 --> 00:08:38.790
They continue to retreat.

00:08:38.790 --> 00:08:39.870
What?!

00:08:39.870 --> 00:08:44.120
Here we are in the thick of battle,
and they're still retreating?

00:08:44.120 --> 00:08:46.450
What's the meaning of this, Heki, sir?

00:08:46.450 --> 00:08:48.910
It <i>is</i> strange--

00:08:48.910 --> 00:08:52.120
This is a general who
attacked quick as lightning

00:08:52.120 --> 00:08:55.700
in all of our sieges so far.

00:08:55.700 --> 00:08:58.080
He may have something up his sleeve, but still,

00:08:58.080 --> 00:09:01.910
the units on the front lines
have been all but abandoned.

00:09:05.830 --> 00:09:10.000
With no orders from HQ,
I suppose we just stay here and fight.

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:14.080
Luckily this place benefits
from being "soggy and sloped"--

00:09:14.080 --> 00:09:15.290
"Soggy" for the marshy areas,

00:09:15.290 --> 00:09:17.830
and "sloped" for the steep terrain.

00:09:17.830 --> 00:09:21.790
That makes it hard to attack here,
but easy to defend.

00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:26.080
We can hold off triple the number
of enemies, even fighting normally!

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:27.790
That's Heki for you.

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:31.290
He's mastered the basics
of strategy over this past year.

00:09:31.290 --> 00:09:33.450
Alert! Alert!

00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:35.080
I-I have terrible news!

00:09:41.250 --> 00:09:43.950
Kyou En's main army is headed this way!

00:09:43.950 --> 00:09:45.910
They number about ten thousand!

00:09:49.410 --> 00:09:50.410
What?!

00:09:50.410 --> 00:09:54.500
This is bad! We're no match
for an army of ten thousand!

00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:56.540
We must bring in reinforcements immediately!

00:09:56.540 --> 00:10:01.370
But even if we do, General Ou Sen's
army is still falling back!

00:10:03.450 --> 00:10:09.120
Heki, sir, the situation has changed.
We must retreat immediately.

00:10:09.120 --> 00:10:12.370
It wasn't easy to find
such advantageous terrain.

00:10:12.370 --> 00:10:14.580
It would be such a shame to leave it behind...

00:10:16.080 --> 00:10:17.450
Still,

00:10:17.450 --> 00:10:21.330
only a foolish commander
would be overly attached to the land.

00:10:23.450 --> 00:10:26.540
Round up the troops and
begin to withdraw at once!

00:10:26.540 --> 00:10:27.160
Yes, sir!

00:10:27.160 --> 00:10:30.000
What's your hurry?

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:31.200
Say what?!

00:10:41.410 --> 00:10:42.910
G-General Ou Sen!

00:10:56.790 --> 00:11:00.250
We heard the main camp was retreating--

00:11:00.250 --> 00:11:02.370
How is it you're here?

00:11:09.830 --> 00:11:14.040
This man is always so intense...

00:11:14.040 --> 00:11:15.750
How can I tell?

00:11:15.750 --> 00:11:21.750
He's watching us with eyes
he'd never turn upon an ally.

00:11:23.330 --> 00:11:26.370
The main camp <i>is</i> retreating.

00:11:26.370 --> 00:11:29.450
I alone left, with two thousand men.

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:33.450
Commander Heki...

00:11:33.450 --> 00:11:35.660
I came to see you.

00:11:36.870 --> 00:11:38.950
Me?

00:11:38.950 --> 00:11:42.870
Your unit is situated here,
successfully repelling the Gi army.

00:11:42.870 --> 00:11:45.000
You must have an eye for strategy.

00:11:45.000 --> 00:11:49.160
And you must know something
about the land that lies ahead.

00:11:49.160 --> 00:11:50.620
Ahead?

00:11:52.410 --> 00:11:53.410
The straits!

00:11:54.950 --> 00:11:58.450
Once through the dangerous entryway,
we'll be surrounded by steep cliffs.

00:11:58.450 --> 00:12:03.500
The path through the straits tapers
as we move toward the way out...

00:12:03.500 --> 00:12:07.160
If we can lure Kyou En into the straits,

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:09.660
we can strike at him and
all his men from up above.

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:12.830
Ten thousand troops could be
intercepted by perhaps half that.

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:19.910
Very well. I can see it was worth
the effort, coming all this way.

00:12:19.910 --> 00:12:23.000
I shall hand over my troops to you.

00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:27.330
Round up the squads nearby and
you should have your five thousand.

00:12:27.330 --> 00:12:31.620
You now have commanding authority over them.

00:12:31.620 --> 00:12:33.580
Heki!

00:12:33.580 --> 00:12:37.040
Henceforth you are a 5,000-man commander.

00:12:37.040 --> 00:12:39.750
Now go stop Kyou En of the Gi army!

00:12:43.200 --> 00:12:46.370
M-Me? A... A 5,000-man commander?!

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:53.250
Yes, sir! Understood! The Heki squad
will intercept Kyou En's army,

00:12:53.250 --> 00:12:55.540
per your command!

00:13:09.910 --> 00:13:14.450
To think General Ou Sen
saw something in me...

00:13:14.450 --> 00:13:17.580
It's no surprise, looking at the battle here.

00:13:17.580 --> 00:13:20.040
Heki, sir, our fight with Kyou En
will be a crucial one

00:13:20.040 --> 00:13:24.120
that decides the fate of the entire left flank.

00:13:24.120 --> 00:13:26.080
I know.

00:13:26.080 --> 00:13:28.830
Heki squad, prepare to move out--and quickly!

00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:38.000
We can do this... we can win!

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:40.660
You don't scare me, Kyou En!

00:13:42.460 --> 00:13:46.000
"Heki"

00:13:47.500 --> 00:13:52.290
Meanwhile, the Gaku Ka Force,
first to infiltrate the main unit...

00:13:58.700 --> 00:14:02.370
We'll be through soon, Mou Ten, sir!

00:14:02.370 --> 00:14:07.410
...was one push away from
successfully escaping Rin Ko's army.

00:14:07.410 --> 00:14:10.830
The troops in back have had it.
Sun Gan, trade places with them!

00:14:10.830 --> 00:14:14.870
Yes, sir! Son Kan unit, after me!

00:14:14.870 --> 00:14:16.620
How many men do we have, Pops?

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:21.450
Maybe about four hundred--
and all of them wounded.

00:14:21.450 --> 00:14:22.950
I see...

00:14:22.950 --> 00:14:25.290
We left with eight hundred;
now we have four...

00:14:25.290 --> 00:14:29.040
A high price to pay for
our attack on the main unit.

00:14:30.410 --> 00:14:35.120
I knew it'd be high, just... not that high.

00:14:35.120 --> 00:14:39.620
All in the name of victory.
The fallen soldiers understood that.

00:14:39.620 --> 00:14:41.500
Yeah...

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:44.620
How are the Hi Shin and
Gyoku Hou Forces holding out?

00:14:44.620 --> 00:14:46.870
I can't really tell from here,

00:14:48.040 --> 00:14:51.870
but there's no indication
that Rin Ko's been killed.

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:54.250
They haven't gotten him yet?!

00:14:54.250 --> 00:14:55.790
Enemies from the left!

00:15:02.410 --> 00:15:04.080
Die!

00:15:12.910 --> 00:15:19.540
Ou Hon, Shin... don't forget
that this is a surprise attack.

00:15:19.540 --> 00:15:22.370
That's the heart of the enemy's main camp.

00:15:22.370 --> 00:15:25.040
Take too long and you'll
be surrounded by tons of foes--

00:15:25.040 --> 00:15:26.660
and lose your path of retreat.

00:15:34.410 --> 00:15:37.500
Just don't miss the right time to pull out.

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:43.620
Some walls can't be overcome, you know.

00:15:43.620 --> 00:15:45.870
No such thing!

00:15:50.620 --> 00:15:53.160
Get the hell out of here already, Ou Hon!

00:15:53.160 --> 00:15:54.450
What?!

00:15:57.500 --> 00:15:59.370
You can keep your concern.

00:15:59.370 --> 00:16:03.830
I am of the Ou clan--
and we repay our debts!

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:11.080
What are you going on about?
You've both clearly reached your limits.

00:16:14.580 --> 00:16:16.410
Isn't Shin back yet?

00:16:23.160 --> 00:16:24.540
Uh-oh!

00:16:33.790 --> 00:16:34.950
Kyou Kai!

00:16:37.910 --> 00:16:39.830
Thank you.

00:16:39.830 --> 00:16:40.870
Look.

00:16:46.370 --> 00:16:48.620
They're headed for Rin Ko's main camp.

00:16:48.620 --> 00:16:51.200
They mean to surround it completely--
and seal them off!

00:16:51.200 --> 00:16:54.200
But where does that leave us?

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:57.500
Hurry up, Shin. We're out of time.

00:17:47.450 --> 00:17:49.160
Commander!

00:17:55.830 --> 00:17:58.910
I guess my weakened upper body
made for a shallow blow.

00:18:05.450 --> 00:18:10.410
Ou Hon isn't taking part in
the battle between those two!

00:18:10.410 --> 00:18:13.620
His injury must be severe...

00:18:13.620 --> 00:18:15.830
We're out of time!

00:18:15.830 --> 00:18:19.450
Ou Hon, sir, we're coming
to join the fight against Rin Ko!

00:18:19.450 --> 00:18:20.660
Don't be ridiculous!

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:24.410
<i>We're</i> the ones watching
over this generals' duel!

00:18:24.410 --> 00:18:25.500
What?!

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:28.830
Do you want to drag your
master's name through the mud?

00:18:37.750 --> 00:18:41.410
Uh-oh... I'm gonna black out...

00:18:44.580 --> 00:18:48.200
Can't hear my men's voices...

00:18:48.200 --> 00:18:51.500
We runnin' outta time?

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:55.700
Sorry, guys--hang in there
just a little longer...

00:18:55.700 --> 00:19:01.250
Feels like... I'm onto somethin' here...

00:19:04.750 --> 00:19:07.620
Lord... Hyou...

00:19:10.290 --> 00:19:13.370
General... Ou Ki...

00:19:18.290 --> 00:19:24.790
Takin' out a lot of people...
That ain't what made 'em powerful...

00:19:26.040 --> 00:19:31.080
Probably... as they fought...
they kept overcomin'...

00:19:32.160 --> 00:19:35.620
Again... and again!

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:49.500
And me...

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:54.500
I think I'll be overcomin' these,
too... soon enough...

00:19:56.040 --> 00:19:58.080
These damn limits of mine!

00:20:13.950 --> 00:20:16.750
Tsk! This boy--

00:20:16.750 --> 00:20:18.290
Has he started to transform?

00:20:21.290 --> 00:20:23.540
All these finishing blows!

00:20:27.950 --> 00:20:29.950
Rin Ko, sir!

00:20:29.950 --> 00:20:31.410
I know, I know!

00:20:56.620 --> 00:20:58.700
Blocked it by a hair... but...

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:08.830
Rin Ko!

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:10.200
You little brat!

00:21:10.200 --> 00:21:12.200
Die!

00:21:15.830 --> 00:21:18.040
Get on. We're backing down.

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:22.410
Wait! Rin Ko--I'm so close!

00:21:22.410 --> 00:21:23.410
No.

00:21:24.790 --> 00:21:28.870
We don't have time for him. Besides...

00:21:31.540 --> 00:21:36.700
Too bad! All we need to do now
is cut you dogs down!

00:21:40.660 --> 00:21:43.750
Assume escape formation!
Hi Shin Unit, you come, too!

00:21:46.250 --> 00:21:50.580
Escape? There's no escaping us!

00:21:50.580 --> 00:21:51.580
There is.

00:21:54.200 --> 00:21:58.120
Ou Hon, sir! We've secured a path of retreat!

00:21:58.120 --> 00:21:59.120
What?!

00:22:04.700 --> 00:22:06.910
After them! Don't let them get away!

00:22:07.910 --> 00:22:09.330
Rin Ko...

00:22:11.750 --> 00:22:13.580
We've held off the marauding troops,

00:22:13.580 --> 00:22:16.000
and will take care of them
before they return to camp.

00:22:16.000 --> 00:22:18.120
But first we must tend to your wounds.

00:22:18.120 --> 00:22:20.000
The main camp is in disarray.

00:22:20.000 --> 00:22:23.750
Perhaps we should back down
for now and regroup.

00:22:23.750 --> 00:22:27.950
No need. There'll be no more surprise attacks,

00:22:27.950 --> 00:22:30.660
and next time, it'll be our turn to strike.

00:22:30.660 --> 00:22:34.080
The Chin army's formation is in shambles, too.

00:22:34.080 --> 00:22:38.290
If we get through that, we can do
twice the damage they did to us.

00:22:38.290 --> 00:22:39.330
Yes, sir!

00:22:42.870 --> 00:22:46.790
He must have gotten me in a tendon.
I can't move my fingers.

00:22:47.790 --> 00:22:52.040
Wounded through carelessness...

00:22:52.040 --> 00:22:54.410
Me, of all people.

00:22:54.410 --> 00:22:59.250
I let down my guard.
Perhaps I underestimated him a little.

00:22:59.250 --> 00:23:02.330
No, that's not all.

00:23:02.330 --> 00:23:06.410
That Shin of the Hi Shin Unit--
he was truly powerful.

00:23:08.830 --> 00:23:11.450
I'll repay you for this left hand.

00:23:11.450 --> 00:23:13.290
Tomorrow is the main event.

00:23:22.830 --> 00:23:31.370
<i>I'm dreaming of you, just like back then</i>

00:23:31.370 --> 00:23:39.830
<i>Trusting, unafraid of anything</i>

00:23:39.830 --> 00:23:48.080
<i>Your words that I always remember</i>

00:23:48.080 --> 00:23:56.540
<i>Are getting fainter,</i>
<i>mixed up, about to disappear</i>

00:23:56.540 --> 00:24:01.500
<i>I go crazy trying to make them out</i>

00:24:01.500 --> 00:24:05.830
<i>Barefoot still, I'd lost my way</i>

00:24:05.830 --> 00:24:10.080
<i>It's okay to stop</i>

00:24:10.080 --> 00:24:14.250
<i>But even if I go after you,</i>
<i>if I hold out my hand</i>

00:24:14.250 --> 00:24:17.500
<i>Don't respond just yet</i>

00:24:17.500 --> 00:24:22.700
<i>But until I forget, don't change</i>

00:24:22.700 --> 00:24:26.870
<i>I ask this of you, and yet</i>

